125
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:40,220
 how we can better improve

126
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:41,080
 the experience

127
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,400
 of our borough council meeting.

128
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:43,860
 I just want to let you know

129
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:44,440
 that we are not

130
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:45,260
 the only council

131
00:03:45,260 --> 00:03:46,400
 in the city of Montreal

132
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:49,420
 that has a 6.30 start

133
00:03:49,420 --> 00:03:50,880
 to our council meetings.

134
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,240
 There are other boroughs

135
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,420
 such as Mercier-Ochalaga-Mazeneuve,

136
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:56,000
 Villeray-Parc-Extension,

137
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:58,920
 and I think there's two others,

138
00:03:59,060 --> 00:03:59,760
 including Ville-Marie.

139
00:04:00,260 --> 00:04:01,240
 So thank you

140
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,020
 for your comments

141
00:04:02,020 --> 00:04:03,340
 and we are going

142
00:04:03,340 --> 00:04:04,140
 to evaluate

143
00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:05,280
 the experience

144
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,360
 of the change

145
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,460
 and we'll see

146
00:04:07,460 --> 00:04:08,520
 what can be

147
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,380
 modified,

148
00:04:09,620 --> 00:04:10,020
 improved,

149
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:11,700
 and it's part

150
00:04:11,700 --> 00:04:13,960
 of a larger change

151
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,740
 that we'd like to bring.

152
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,700
 So the three

153
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:18,320
 next questions

154
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:18,860
 concerne

155
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:19,480
 Terrebonne

156
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,980
 de Rita Mathias-Caravello,

157
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:22,760
 Claire Lavoie,

158
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:24,300
 Giuseppina Moretti.

159
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:28,540
 Donc la prochaine question

160
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:29,800
 de Anne Coy

161
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,880
 concerne

162
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:32,700
 un projet multirésidentiel

163
00:04:32,700 --> 00:04:34,960
 sur de la Savane.

164
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,680
 La question s'adresse

165
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:36,500
 à Mme Valenzuela.

166
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:38,640
 Le projet multirésidentiel

167
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:40,520
 au 4280 rue de la Savane

168
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,220
 aurait pu livrer

169
00:04:41,220 --> 00:04:42,680
 375 logements

170
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,720
 dont 20 %

171
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,240
 offrent un loyer réduit.

172
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:46,320
 Or, ce projet

173
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:47,160
 est tombé à l'eau

174
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,360
 en raison de consultations

175
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,060
 qui durent depuis

176
00:04:49,060 --> 00:04:49,960
 plus de trois ans

177
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,280
 et au râlage risible

178
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,060
 de citoyens.

179
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:53,160
 Comment pouvez-vous

180
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,200
 continuer de défendre

181
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,400
 de la tergiversation

182
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:57,700
 sous forme de consultations

183
00:04:57,700 --> 00:04:58,840
 qui s'éternisent

184
00:04:58,840 --> 00:04:59,500
 et des dialogues

185
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:00,440
 avec des opposants

186
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,160
 de n'importe quel

187
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,060
 projet immobilier?

188
00:05:03,460 --> 00:05:04,320
 Merci beaucoup

189
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,460
 Anne Coydo

190
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:06,360
 pour votre question

191
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,020
 concernant un projet

192
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:08,600
 dans l'arrondissement

193
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,120
 de colonnage

194
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:09,840
 Notre-Dame-de-Grasse.

195
00:05:10,020 --> 00:05:10,660
 Je vois que vous n'êtes

196
00:05:10,660 --> 00:05:11,380
 pas nécessairement

197
00:05:11,380 --> 00:05:12,680
 un résident de notre quartier.

198
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,000
 Par rapport à ce projet-ci,

199
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:16,220
 je pense que c'est important

200
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:18,940
 de dire qu'il y a des besoins

201
00:05:18,940 --> 00:05:20,200
 criants dans l'arrondissement

202
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:20,680
 de colonnage

203
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,420
 Notre-Dame-de-Grasse,

204
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,900
 oui, au niveau de logement,

205
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,040
 mais aussi par rapport

206
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,360
 à nos services,

207
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,860
 par rapport aux espaces verts.

208
00:05:27,980 --> 00:05:28,760
 On est l'arrondissement

209
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:29,640
 le plus populaire

210
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:30,660
 de la ville de Montréal

211
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:33,560
 et qui continue à développer.

212
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,400
 Nous avons tout le secteur

213
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,180
 de la savane

214
00:05:37,180 --> 00:05:38,180
 qui va éventuellement

215
00:05:38,180 --> 00:05:39,820
 développer tout le secteur

216
00:05:39,820 --> 00:05:40,460
 de Namur,

217
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:41,400
 incluant aussi

218
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:42,640
 le secteur de l'hippodrome

219
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,440
 où dans ce secteur-ci,

220
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,940
 il y aura plus de 50 %

221
00:05:45,940 --> 00:05:47,180
 des développements

222
00:05:47,180 --> 00:05:48,500
 qui seront hors marché.

223
00:05:49,180 --> 00:05:50,160
 Quand nous parlons

224
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:50,680
 des besoins

225
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,300
 de nos résidents,

226
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:52,520
 on parle, par exemple,

227
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,020
 au niveau

228
00:05:53,020 --> 00:05:55,600
 d'accès aux écoles.

229
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:56,340
 On a entendu

230
00:05:56,340 --> 00:05:58,100
 plusieurs reprises

231
00:05:58,100 --> 00:05:59,160
 dans ce mandat-ci

232
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,260
 et dans les derniers mandats

233
00:06:00,260 --> 00:06:01,540
 qu'il y a un besoin

234
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:02,580
 par rapport

235
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:03,480
 à nos familles

236
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,500
 d'avoir accès

237
00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:05,240
 à des écoles.

238
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,440
 Donc, il faut vraiment

239
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:07,420
 comprendre que lorsque

240
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:08,280
 nous mettons en place

241
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:08,760
 un projet,

242
00:06:08,900 --> 00:06:09,600
 nous ne pensons pas

243
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,640
 nécessairement juste

244
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:11,680
 au toit

245
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,120
 qui vient avec le projet.

246
00:06:13,280 --> 00:06:14,640
 On pense à tous les besoins

247
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:17,040
 entourant ce projet aussi.

248
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:18,640
 On pense à la capacité

249
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:20,000
 d'accueillir dans le secteur,

250
00:06:20,340 --> 00:06:21,080
 que ce soit au niveau

251
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,080
 des infrastructures.

252
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:24,080
 On pense vraiment

253
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:24,980
 à tous les besoins.

254
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:26,180
 On ne veut pas juste

255
00:06:26,180 --> 00:06:26,820
 mettre des maisons

256
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:27,420
 ici et là.

257
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:28,260
 Ce n'est pas un dortoir

258
00:06:28,260 --> 00:06:29,000
 qu'on essaie de mettre

259
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,080
 en place dans notre arrondissement.

260
00:06:30,220 --> 00:06:30,800
 On essaie de mettre

261
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:31,820
 un quartier complet

262
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:33,200
 qui fait en sorte

263
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,040
 qu'on assure

264
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:34,900
 une qualité de vie

265
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:36,840
 et aussi qu'on est capable

266
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:37,800
 de garder nos résidents

267
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,660
 dans notre arrondissement

268
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:40,220
 parce que c'est important

269
00:06:40,220 --> 00:06:41,280
