270
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:42,240
 Donc, merci encore

271
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,000
 pour votre question.

272
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:45,640
 Une prochaine question

273
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,040
 de Amish Mekponoky.

274
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,400
 Je vais lire seulement

275
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,160
 sa première question

276
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:49,780
 parce que la deuxième

277
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:50,580
 touche Terrebonne.

278
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,760
 Donc, la première question

